WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:06.411
Foundation model providers ship updates. Sometimes those updates meaningfully change agent behavior.

2
00:00:06.433 --> 00:00:11.204
Validated against which version? This week's? Or the one that ships next Tuesday?

3
00:00:11.233 --> 00:00:14.524
Version becomes a first-class governance control.

4
00:00:14.533 --> 00:00:20.264
The fix is to pin specific versions, require re-validation before upgrades,

5
00:00:20.267 --> 00:00:24.998
and negotiate behavior-change notification into the provider contract.
